WEBVTT

00:07.665 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.345 --> 01:38.985
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:53.185 --> 01:54.345
Luke!

02:00.065 --> 02:02.265
Look. Just look at what you've done.

02:03.065 --> 02:03.905
Have you lost your mind?

02:06.105 --> 02:06.945
Don't move.

02:09.665 --> 02:10.785
I'm gonna smack you.

02:10.864 --> 02:12.065
Take that.

02:13.105 --> 02:14.305
Let's see if you dare do it again.

02:16.345 --> 02:17.785
Next time you trash the place,

02:17.865 --> 02:20.185
I'll throw you out and let you be a stray.

02:24.745 --> 02:25.745
Playing pitiful now?

02:28.225 --> 02:29.465
Just like your mom.

02:30.025 --> 02:30.945
Come here!

02:41.625 --> 02:42.665
Don't give me that.

02:55.985 --> 02:56.905
All right.

03:01.225 --> 03:02.105
Have a treat.

03:10.545 --> 03:11.625
Paw.

03:14.025 --> 03:14.865
And this one.

03:15.385 --> 03:18.625
NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
DURING THE FILMING OF THIS PRODUCTION

03:19.945 --> 03:20.825
What happened to your paw?

03:23.425 --> 03:24.585
Does it hurt?

03:25.185 --> 03:26.305
Does it hurt, Luke?

03:30.945 --> 03:31.825
It's okay.

03:35.225 --> 03:36.145
Hello?

03:37.065 --> 03:38.785
Has your dog's paw ever lost fur?

03:39.345 --> 03:40.625
Will it kill him?

03:40.705 --> 03:41.785
Oh no. It's terminal.

03:44.985 --> 03:46.185
What should I do?

03:46.265 --> 03:47.185
Which hospital should I take him to?

03:48.825 --> 03:50.865
I'm messing with you. Relax.

03:50.945 --> 03:52.625
Ms. Shang's dog is a lucky one.

03:52.705 --> 03:53.945
How could anything happen to him?

03:54.025 --> 03:55.345
It's probably just inflamed.

03:55.425 --> 03:56.985
Put some iodine on it
and keep an eye on it.

03:57.065 --> 03:58.145
Don't worry.

04:03.345 --> 04:05.745
You'll be fine. Come on.
Let's put some medicine on your paw.

04:07.345 --> 04:08.385
Let's go.

04:09.905 --> 04:10.745
Over here.

04:12.265 --> 04:15.665
THINKING OF YOU THIS SECOND
SEEING YOU THE NEXT

04:19.985 --> 04:21.865
Sit. Come here.

04:26.865 --> 04:27.945
Sit.

04:29.505 --> 04:30.345
Sit.

04:32.065 --> 04:32.985
Come on, let's put some medicine on it.

04:33.625 --> 04:34.865
You can eat after we're done.

04:35.545 --> 04:36.385
Give me your paw.

04:38.025 --> 04:39.065
Come on.

04:40.185 --> 04:41.465
Hold still.

04:44.305 --> 04:45.705
Good. Almost done.

04:46.905 --> 04:48.025
Let me see.

04:52.145 --> 04:53.745
All done. Here.

04:56.025 --> 04:57.185
Eat.

04:59.625 --> 05:00.625
Sit.

05:00.705 --> 05:01.625
Sit.

05:03.225 --> 05:04.185
Eat.

05:05.305 --> 05:06.865
ZANG YAO

05:09.745 --> 05:11.145
I'm leaving.

05:11.225 --> 05:12.505
Want to meet?

05:16.105 --> 05:17.065
Sure.

05:29.865 --> 05:31.505
The meat here really is different.

05:31.585 --> 05:32.425
It smells amazing.

05:44.305 --> 05:45.625
Need a hand?

05:45.705 --> 05:46.585
No.

05:49.305 --> 05:53.785
Your window is held together with tape?

05:55.665 --> 05:56.865
It seals the gaps.

05:57.545 --> 05:59.265
What made you suddenly decide
to come see me?

06:01.425 --> 06:03.505
Wasn't I in Inner Mongolia
looking for investors?

06:04.185 --> 06:05.545
I figured I wasn't that far from you.

06:05.625 --> 06:08.025
Just a train ride away.

06:08.585 --> 06:09.465
So I came to see you.

06:11.065 --> 06:15.185
Twelve hours by train
isn't exactly nearby.

06:18.065 --> 06:19.145
True enough.

06:20.385 --> 06:21.265
It was so last minute.

06:22.025 --> 06:23.385
The sleeper tickets were sold out.

06:23.465 --> 06:24.825
I sat the whole way here.

06:24.905 --> 06:26.225
My back is killing me.

06:29.105 --> 06:31.225
Is there a hotel nearby?

06:32.145 --> 06:34.185
I'll settle in for the night first.

06:34.745 --> 06:37.225
The nearest guesthouse
is three hours away.

06:37.825 --> 06:38.985
Three hours?

06:41.865 --> 06:42.985
Then what do we do?

06:48.465 --> 06:49.545
-You sleep here.
-I'll sleep over there.

06:49.625 --> 06:51.265
-You take the bed.
-You…

06:51.345 --> 06:52.785
I'll take the couch.

06:52.865 --> 06:54.705
-I'll take the couch.
-I'll…

06:56.985 --> 06:58.025
Let's eat first.

06:58.545 --> 06:59.665
Okay.

07:03.785 --> 07:05.105
Try this.

07:18.305 --> 07:19.305
Sit.

07:25.265 --> 07:27.385
Weren't you planning to stay
in Beijing for another two years?

07:31.465 --> 07:32.345
Not anymore.

07:38.145 --> 07:38.985
Whose dog is this?

07:40.305 --> 07:41.225
Mine.

07:43.425 --> 07:44.625
I've known you for years.

07:44.705 --> 07:46.105
You'd never get a dog.

07:46.185 --> 07:47.745
If you were going to get one,
it'd be a Tibetan Mastiff.

07:50.865 --> 07:51.945
It's Shang Zhitao's dog, isn't it?

07:53.065 --> 07:54.865
Yeah. It's her dog.

07:58.105 --> 07:59.105
When are you leaving?

08:00.345 --> 08:01.185
The day after tomorrow.

08:02.185 --> 08:03.025
So soon?

08:05.145 --> 08:06.345
Beijing isn't interesting anymore.

08:07.065 --> 08:08.345
I'm going back to the UK.

08:09.345 --> 08:10.585
At this point,

08:11.265 --> 08:14.665
Beijing doesn't really have anything
to do with me anymore.

08:17.225 --> 08:18.065
Have you made up your mind?

08:21.545 --> 08:24.065
Whether I have or not,
would it change anything?

08:26.345 --> 08:28.425
I came back for you.

08:29.305 --> 08:31.465
But if you're no longer
the person you used to be,

08:31.545 --> 08:33.385
how could I force you?

08:34.545 --> 08:35.985
Or are you saying that to make me stay,

08:36.664 --> 08:38.144
you'd give me what I've always wanted?

08:44.865 --> 08:46.265
He's pretty loyal.

08:46.345 --> 08:47.625
Keeping an eye on you for his owner.

08:50.385 --> 08:52.945
Then I wish you a safe journey

08:53.505 --> 08:55.105
and that everything
goes your way from now on.

08:58.785 --> 08:59.825
Luan Nian.

09:01.545 --> 09:04.145
Won't you give me one last hug?

09:21.745 --> 09:22.825
All right.

09:23.345 --> 09:24.225
Let's go.

09:28.385 --> 09:29.425
Go.

09:31.105 --> 09:32.145
Go.

09:47.545 --> 09:48.705
Go.

09:54.945 --> 09:55.865
Luan Nian.

09:56.465 --> 09:57.385
Goodbye.

09:59.225 --> 10:00.865
Keeping an eye on me for your owner, huh?

10:02.305 --> 10:03.625
What are we now?

10:03.705 --> 10:04.625
Why would you do that?

10:08.505 --> 10:09.385
Let's go home.

10:09.905 --> 10:10.985
Come on.

10:40.425 --> 10:41.465
Yuanzhu.

10:42.465 --> 10:43.545
Are you sleepy?

10:46.105 --> 10:47.825
I'm a little scared.

10:49.305 --> 10:50.625
I can't fall asleep.

10:53.625 --> 10:55.625
I thought nothing ever scared you.

10:57.425 --> 10:58.505
Listen.

10:59.625 --> 11:01.425
Listen to the wind
rustling the window paper.

11:02.105 --> 11:03.505
Then start counting.

11:04.025 --> 11:07.025
One, two, three.

11:07.705 --> 11:08.825
You'll be asleep before you know it.

11:09.545 --> 11:10.585
Give it a try.

11:27.545 --> 11:29.105
I still can't sleep.

11:29.185 --> 11:31.905
How about you keep me company for a while?

11:34.025 --> 11:34.865
Go ahead.

11:36.785 --> 11:38.905
When you're away on business by yourself,

11:39.945 --> 11:41.225
do you miss home?

11:46.905 --> 11:47.865
Of course I do.

11:50.145 --> 11:53.185
Your hometown is up
in the mountains, right?

11:54.345 --> 11:57.465
After this business trip,
I'll go back with you and take a look.

11:57.545 --> 11:59.585
I meant my home in Beijing.

12:02.705 --> 12:05.785
Aren't you, Lei, and Tao my family?

12:10.785 --> 12:13.145
Of course we are.

12:24.185 --> 12:25.225
Yuanzhu.

12:28.425 --> 12:29.385
Mr. Genius.

12:30.985 --> 12:36.545
Do you think I'm a good person?

12:39.505 --> 12:40.945
You are.

12:41.025 --> 12:44.145
You're my best friend and family.

12:55.105 --> 12:56.505
Look.

12:56.585 --> 13:02.545
We've been living under the same roof
for over three years.

13:03.825 --> 13:05.905
I really like your cooking.

13:08.825 --> 13:11.745
And I don't think you dislike me either.

13:13.985 --> 13:16.185
Honestly…

13:17.145 --> 13:19.625
When friends and family come to see me,
it makes me really happy.

13:20.145 --> 13:21.985
Especially you. You're my best friend.

13:24.145 --> 13:24.985
How about this?

13:25.065 --> 13:27.665
Tomorrow afternoon I'll take you
for lamb with Mongolian chives.

13:27.745 --> 13:29.105
It's our most authentic local specialty.

13:29.185 --> 13:30.425
Then I'll take you to the station.

13:31.185 --> 13:33.305
Or I can book you a hotel
for tomorrow night.

13:33.385 --> 13:34.745
You can stay
a couple more days if you want.

13:35.585 --> 13:37.785
It's just that I have work
these next two days,

13:37.865 --> 13:39.145
so I probably won't be able
to keep you company.

13:39.865 --> 13:40.945
Don't be mad at me.

13:47.625 --> 13:49.425
Don't say things like that.

13:50.145 --> 13:51.705
It doesn't sound sincere.

13:53.865 --> 13:56.905
If anyone should apologize,
it should be me.

13:56.985 --> 13:59.985
Don't be upset that I suddenly showed up
and caused you trouble.

14:05.225 --> 14:07.345
You don't need to worry about me tomorrow.

14:07.425 --> 14:08.385
I'll just look around on my own.

14:11.705 --> 14:12.985
And I'll…

14:13.065 --> 14:15.465
I'll… I'll buy my own ticket back.

14:15.545 --> 14:16.625
You don't have to worry about me.

14:17.185 --> 14:18.025
I'll get the ticket.

14:19.585 --> 14:21.025
It's late. Get some sleep.

14:21.545 --> 14:23.025
You've had a long day.

14:23.785 --> 14:25.105
I'm a little tired too.

14:29.625 --> 14:30.825
Good night.

14:47.145 --> 14:48.825
The wind really is strong.

14:51.745 --> 14:53.185
Let's count.

14:55.305 --> 14:56.585
Didn't you say

14:58.025 --> 14:59.745
counting helps you fall asleep?

15:01.505 --> 15:02.505
One.

15:03.985 --> 15:05.105
Two.

15:06.065 --> 15:06.945
Three.

15:10.745 --> 15:11.785
Four.

15:13.545 --> 15:14.505
Five.

15:15.545 --> 15:16.385
Six.

15:18.385 --> 15:19.425
Seven.

15:29.945 --> 15:31.265
How's Luke?

15:31.345 --> 15:32.705
Is his paw still inflamed?

15:35.025 --> 15:35.905
Not good.

15:37.065 --> 15:38.745
How could it not be?

15:39.745 --> 15:41.145
Let me see him.

15:42.185 --> 15:43.265
Here.

15:47.185 --> 15:49.265
See? He's perfectly fine. You're lying.

15:49.865 --> 15:50.705
Luke.

15:52.425 --> 15:53.825
That silly dog does nothing but bark.

15:53.905 --> 15:54.745
He's so noisy.

15:56.265 --> 15:59.345
Well, how are you?

16:00.985 --> 16:02.865
Still alive. Getting by.

16:03.545 --> 16:04.585
How about you?

16:05.105 --> 16:06.345
You are calling this late.

16:06.425 --> 16:07.625
Are you working overtime?

16:10.945 --> 16:12.385
How's the work environment in Hangzhou?

16:13.025 --> 16:14.105
Getting used to the new team?

16:16.025 --> 16:17.345
Do you want the truth or a lie?

16:19.145 --> 16:20.105
The truth.

16:24.145 --> 16:27.945
I think Dony
is a very clear-headed leader.

16:28.025 --> 16:30.545
The instructions he gives everyone
are always very clear.

16:32.865 --> 16:35.225
You'll be sold down the river
and still thank them for it.

16:36.785 --> 16:39.745
Look at you. You asked for the truth.

16:39.825 --> 16:42.385
I'm just trying to know my opponent
before the battle.

16:42.985 --> 16:44.105
What battle?

16:45.025 --> 16:46.025
He's your boss.

16:48.065 --> 16:49.825
You seem pretty hostile toward him.

16:50.985 --> 16:52.185
Do you two have history?

16:53.545 --> 16:54.585
No.

16:54.665 --> 16:55.585
From now on, when you call,

16:55.665 --> 16:57.505
don't sound like
you're reporting to your boss.

16:59.425 --> 17:01.185
Just tell me when you're coming back.

17:01.785 --> 17:02.745
I'll be waiting for you.

17:04.065 --> 17:05.305
I'll come back as soon as I'm done.

17:41.265 --> 17:44.745
I just meant that in the workplace,
no one's doing anyone a favor.

17:44.825 --> 17:46.425
There's no need to act
like you're above everyone else.

17:49.865 --> 17:50.745
Don't catch a cold.

17:51.825 --> 17:52.825
You should head back.

17:54.665 --> 17:56.345
These are your New Year's gifts.

17:56.425 --> 17:57.545
How about I treat you?

17:57.625 --> 17:59.025
Let's go see a movie tonight.

17:59.625 --> 18:00.665
You said it.

18:01.305 --> 18:03.665
It wasn't easy for the four of us
to become friends.

18:04.345 --> 18:06.065
We'll always look out for you.

18:09.065 --> 18:10.945
Every gathering must come to an end.

18:11.465 --> 18:13.025
People come and go.

18:14.825 --> 18:16.385
That's just part of life.

18:54.225 --> 18:57.305
What do you think of Dony's abilities?

18:57.385 --> 18:58.105
DONY'S CV

18:59.665 --> 19:00.585
I've heard he's pretty capable.

19:00.665 --> 19:05.185
He's very clear-headed
and has a clear strategy for the division.

19:06.505 --> 19:08.505
Are you complimenting him?

19:09.185 --> 19:11.465
At the meeting last time,

19:11.545 --> 19:13.585
I thought you were pretty hard on him.

19:14.585 --> 19:15.705
Did you know each other before?

19:17.425 --> 19:19.145
Yes, but I'd rather never meet him again.

19:21.225 --> 19:23.985
You don't think he came
to Lime because of you, do you?

19:25.785 --> 19:26.945
Let's hope not.

19:27.465 --> 19:29.465
I've worked in HR
at Lime for so many years.

19:29.545 --> 19:30.825
He's the first person
who didn't go through

19:30.905 --> 19:32.825
our HR department
before being assigned here.

19:33.745 --> 19:36.105
And as soon as he arrived,
he took over your New Media team.

19:36.625 --> 19:39.865
I don't think it's that simple.

19:42.985 --> 19:44.345
Did you do a background check on him?

19:45.305 --> 19:46.945
He was hired directly by the board.

19:47.025 --> 19:48.465
How was our department
supposed to do a background check?

19:49.465 --> 19:50.945
Then I suggest you do it.

19:51.745 --> 19:52.905
You might find a surprise.

19:55.305 --> 19:56.305
Don't worry.

19:57.065 --> 19:58.665
I'm already looking into it.

20:12.625 --> 20:13.465
Come eat.

20:19.865 --> 20:21.025
Here.

20:23.745 --> 20:25.745
The meat pie's hot. Eat slowly.

20:26.425 --> 20:27.465
Don't burn your mouth.

20:33.345 --> 20:35.145
Slow down. I'm not
going to take it from you.

20:35.745 --> 20:36.785
Have some vegetables.

20:39.225 --> 20:40.065
Silly dog.

20:50.025 --> 20:51.025
Hello?

20:52.185 --> 20:53.665
Your silly dog is eating the meat pie.

20:54.265 --> 20:55.105
Have you eaten?

20:55.625 --> 20:56.825
What are you having for dinner?

20:58.225 --> 20:59.465
I'm going to stir-fry a couple of dishes.

21:00.105 --> 21:02.025
And make some osmanthus milk.

21:02.825 --> 21:03.865
Why?

21:04.545 --> 21:05.625
You want some?

21:08.985 --> 21:10.505
Then come back soon if you do.

21:10.585 --> 21:12.825
You'll have to wait for me.

21:51.865 --> 21:53.145
Why are you back?

21:53.745 --> 21:55.825
I came back to report something for work,
then I'm leaving.

22:02.265 --> 22:03.425
I missed you.

22:28.105 --> 22:28.945
Everyone,

22:29.665 --> 22:33.305
to more efficiently advance
the New Media campaign

22:33.385 --> 22:34.705
for Xizi Cultural Tourism Group,

22:35.305 --> 22:37.265
the company has decided
to form a dedicated project team

22:38.105 --> 22:40.705
to be stationed on-site
for in-depth operations.

22:41.225 --> 22:42.345
The team members are as follows.

22:42.425 --> 22:43.465
Kitty.

22:44.425 --> 22:46.185
Claire. Leo.

22:46.265 --> 22:47.825
Kangkang. Sunny.

22:47.905 --> 22:49.505
Kami. William.

22:49.585 --> 22:51.305
Lucy. Flora.

22:55.065 --> 22:56.505
Dony.

22:56.585 --> 22:59.865
I've always been responsible
for the Beijing New Media team.

22:59.945 --> 23:01.225
I won't be going this time.

23:01.305 --> 23:02.945
I'll stay in Beijing
and support all of you.

23:03.745 --> 23:05.625
Anyone can opt out, except you.

23:06.905 --> 23:09.385
You'll be leading
this dedicated project team.

23:11.265 --> 23:12.625
Let's wrap up the meeting here.

23:21.065 --> 23:22.105
Flora.

23:22.185 --> 23:23.345
Come have a seat.

23:33.665 --> 23:35.865
I've read your report on this project.

23:35.945 --> 23:37.225
You did an excellent job.

23:37.745 --> 23:39.145
You identified the key issues
very accurately.

23:40.065 --> 23:43.025
And the three core client concerns
you raised

23:43.625 --> 23:46.305
are exactly what we need
to address first at the workshop.

23:47.225 --> 23:48.225
Well done.

23:48.305 --> 23:49.625
Thank you, Dony.

23:54.265 --> 23:57.065
Do you trust Luke?

24:01.705 --> 24:05.225
Luke is very capable,
and he's strict with all of us.

24:05.305 --> 24:07.705
We've learned a lot from him.

24:07.785 --> 24:09.345
We all respect him.

24:11.265 --> 24:13.425
Flora, you need to understand this.

24:14.305 --> 24:17.225
Anyone in that position,
with the resources it comes with,

24:17.825 --> 24:19.305
would appear highly capable.

24:20.025 --> 24:22.305
Anyone in that position
would have that halo.

24:22.905 --> 24:24.745
Don't be blinded by it.

24:27.145 --> 24:28.105
I looked into your background.

24:28.185 --> 24:29.545
You earned your place
in the New Media Division

24:29.625 --> 24:30.705
through open competition.

24:31.465 --> 24:34.025
This project is another opportunity.

24:34.625 --> 24:36.745
You can learn just as much
by working with me,

24:36.825 --> 24:39.305
and you'll be promoted much faster.

24:49.505 --> 24:52.305
Dony is clearly trying to poach people
and expand his team.

24:52.385 --> 24:54.425
Are you sure you want to take leave
at a time like this?

24:55.105 --> 24:57.225
So you're saying
I should fight for it too?

24:57.825 --> 24:59.745
Have two opposing pawns
fight tooth and nail,

25:00.585 --> 25:04.225
so the board can sit back
and enjoy the show?

25:06.425 --> 25:08.865
I guess you're retreating to advance.

25:09.985 --> 25:13.305
But you've retreated too far,
letting your opponent seize the advantage.

25:13.385 --> 25:16.665
It won't be easy
to turn things around after that.

25:20.665 --> 25:21.825
Senior,

25:22.785 --> 25:24.665
thank you for putting up with me
all these years.

25:25.225 --> 25:27.585
And no matter what,
you've always been on my side.

25:28.505 --> 25:31.265
But I'd also ask you
to keep an eye on the new guy.

25:31.945 --> 25:33.865
If he really goes too far,

25:33.945 --> 25:36.825
we'll be the ones
left to clean up the mess.

25:38.225 --> 25:39.305
Exactly.

25:39.385 --> 25:40.865
That's what I'm worried about.

25:41.505 --> 25:43.905
Today the board can bypass us
and bring in Dony.

25:43.985 --> 25:47.265
Tomorrow they could easily
send us an HRBP.

25:48.305 --> 25:50.145
Hurry up and process my annual leave.

25:50.665 --> 25:51.745
I'm taking some time off to clear my head.

25:52.345 --> 25:54.145
If I'm in a good mood,

25:54.225 --> 25:55.905
I might even help you prepare
for what's coming.

25:57.705 --> 25:58.825
Thanks, Junior.

25:58.905 --> 26:00.025
You're welcome.

26:00.825 --> 26:02.425
Thank you, my dear Senior.

26:14.345 --> 26:16.185
Dony's a really nice guy.

26:16.265 --> 26:17.985
He doesn't put on airs at all.

26:18.065 --> 26:19.505
Yesterday, he even asked me

26:19.585 --> 26:22.145
if work was going smoothly
and whether I lived far away.

26:22.945 --> 26:24.465
He really is easy to get along with.

26:24.545 --> 26:25.585
He asked me yesterday too.

26:25.665 --> 26:27.665
He wanted to know what I like to do

26:27.745 --> 26:29.625
and what I usually do on weekends.

26:29.705 --> 26:31.105
He even asked if I had a boyfriend.

26:31.185 --> 26:34.385
He said there are a lot of outstanding
young men at headquarters

26:34.465 --> 26:35.785
and that I should get
to know some of them.

26:38.185 --> 26:39.225
Tao.

26:44.825 --> 26:48.345
Dony's way of winning people over
is really straightforward.

26:49.105 --> 26:50.985
I heard the board
sent him to replace Luke.

26:53.065 --> 26:54.945
The board isn't happy with Luke.

26:55.025 --> 26:55.865
They think he's too hard to manage.

27:18.345 --> 27:20.625
Where did this young golden boy come from?

27:23.465 --> 27:24.945
Excuse me. Who's Lumi?

27:27.545 --> 27:28.385
I am.

27:30.905 --> 27:31.745
And you are?

27:50.385 --> 27:51.545
What's going on?

27:53.265 --> 27:55.825
I don't know
where HR found this old academic.

27:56.425 --> 27:58.985
What kind of so-called
marketing expert is he?

27:59.065 --> 28:01.025
Why do I have to report everything to him?

28:01.105 --> 28:02.345
Even Luan Nian couldn't control me.

28:02.425 --> 28:05.825
Now he's setting all these rules
for me to follow.

28:05.905 --> 28:07.105
Why should I?

28:08.305 --> 28:09.465
What's going on?

28:11.745 --> 28:13.225
Luke just went on leave,

28:13.305 --> 28:15.705
and the company brings in
this marketing expert.

28:18.105 --> 28:19.185
This Will…

28:19.265 --> 28:22.545
Could Dony have sent him
to make things difficult for me?

28:23.665 --> 28:24.505
No, wait.

28:24.585 --> 28:27.385
Dony can even interfere
with HR's responsibilities now?

28:28.785 --> 28:30.065
On this business trip,

28:30.145 --> 28:32.305
you have to keep a close eye
on things for Luan Nian.

28:34.505 --> 28:35.425
Don't worry.

28:39.025 --> 28:39.865
No.

28:40.385 --> 28:41.265
I can't just sit back and do nothing.

28:41.945 --> 28:44.625
I have to find out
where this old academic came from.

28:58.985 --> 29:01.545
HANGZHOU

29:01.625 --> 29:02.545
-Dony.
-You're here.

29:03.985 --> 29:05.265
Have a seat.

29:08.105 --> 29:09.785
Flora. Don't sit by the door.

29:09.865 --> 29:11.185
Sit over here.

29:22.345 --> 29:23.505
Dony.

29:23.585 --> 29:25.905
This fish
is this restaurant's signature dish.

29:25.985 --> 29:27.225
Please, try some.

29:31.025 --> 29:32.065
You first.

29:32.585 --> 29:33.585
Thank you.

29:35.465 --> 29:39.465
I think the key visual
for this project is extremely creative.

29:39.545 --> 29:41.065
Kangkang did a great job.

29:41.825 --> 29:43.185
Thank you, Dony. Just doing my job.

29:44.105 --> 29:45.065
No need to be so polite.

29:45.785 --> 29:48.505
Now that our dedicated project team
has been formed, we're one family.

29:48.585 --> 29:50.025
We're one team.

29:50.105 --> 29:50.985
Just call me Dony.

29:51.065 --> 29:52.825
Treat this like you're at home.

29:53.505 --> 29:56.065
Relax, everyone. Don't hold back.

29:56.145 --> 29:57.185
Come on. Cheers.

29:58.505 --> 30:01.065
I… I can't drink.
I'll toast with water instead.

30:02.185 --> 30:04.185
I don't drink much either.
I'll use tea instead.

30:05.265 --> 30:07.425
It's just wine. One glass won't hurt.

30:07.505 --> 30:09.105
It's even good for your skin.

30:09.185 --> 30:10.305
Just one glass.

30:10.905 --> 30:11.905
Here.

30:25.705 --> 30:29.865
This toast is to wish
our dedicated project team

30:29.945 --> 30:32.945
great success here in Hangzhou.

30:33.025 --> 30:33.905
Cheers.

30:36.025 --> 30:37.065
To a great success.

30:38.785 --> 30:40.305
Kangkang, it's okay.

30:40.385 --> 30:41.585
If you don't want to drink, don't.

30:42.185 --> 30:43.505
At Lime, we have a tradition.

30:43.585 --> 30:44.825
We drink, but we never pressure anyone to.

30:44.905 --> 30:47.105
Especially not our female employees.

30:49.945 --> 30:52.865
Dony, you were just excited, right?

30:52.945 --> 30:54.625
He was only asking us to take a sip.

30:57.185 --> 30:58.225
Flora's right.

31:00.865 --> 31:02.385
Just a sip is enough. Don't drink anymore.

31:06.625 --> 31:08.785
Flora. Do you have a boyfriend?

31:12.145 --> 31:15.225
That's a private matter,
so I'd rather not say.

31:15.985 --> 31:17.425
Why keep it a secret?

31:17.985 --> 31:20.585
I don't mind saying it. I'm single.

31:24.945 --> 31:25.985
Dony,

31:27.625 --> 31:28.945
this toast is for you.

31:29.585 --> 31:32.025
Thank you for bringing us here to learn.

31:32.865 --> 31:34.705
Take your time. I'll finish mine.

31:45.625 --> 31:46.825
Look at Kitty.

31:47.825 --> 31:51.225
That's what I call bringing energy to work
and passion to life.

31:52.305 --> 31:53.585
Everyone should learn from her.

31:54.265 --> 31:55.265
Come on.

32:02.585 --> 32:03.585
I need to take this. Excuse me.

32:13.705 --> 32:15.105
A stroke?

32:15.785 --> 32:17.225
When did it happen?

32:17.825 --> 32:18.865
Is it serious?

32:19.705 --> 32:20.745
They caught it in time.

32:20.825 --> 32:21.825
He's not in any danger.

32:24.905 --> 32:26.025
I'm calling because

32:26.105 --> 32:28.145
I've got an urgent job
that has to be submitted today.

32:28.225 --> 32:29.665
You worked on this project before,

32:30.345 --> 32:32.465
so I was hoping you could help me.

32:33.545 --> 32:34.425
Don't worry.

32:34.505 --> 32:35.665
I'll take care of all the work for you.

32:36.265 --> 32:38.505
Can you handle everything
at the hospital by yourself?

32:38.585 --> 32:39.585
I think so.

32:39.665 --> 32:41.745
My mom and I are taking shifts,
and we'll hire a caregiver.

32:42.345 --> 32:44.665
I'll be at the hospital
the next couple of days.

32:44.745 --> 32:48.465
I'm just worried
that jerk Will won't approve my leave.

32:49.425 --> 32:52.185
He can't be that unreasonable.

32:52.265 --> 32:53.585
You never know.

32:54.385 --> 32:56.145
He just chewed me out
at yesterday's meeting.

32:56.225 --> 32:59.585
For clocking in and out on time
and being irresponsible.

32:59.665 --> 33:00.745
What an old fossil.

33:01.345 --> 33:03.305
What's wrong with clocking
in and out on time? What's wrong?

33:03.905 --> 33:05.745
Exactly. He doesn't know
how good our Lumi is

33:05.825 --> 33:07.865
at managing her time.

33:07.945 --> 33:11.705
Now I'm completely convinced
he's Dony's plant.

33:11.785 --> 33:13.985
They're trying to drive away
that stubborn mule's right-hand men,

33:14.065 --> 33:15.465
and once they do, they've won.

33:18.065 --> 33:19.545
How are things on Dony's side?

33:20.065 --> 33:20.905
Busy?

33:23.145 --> 33:24.545
Not at all. Everything's going well.

33:25.625 --> 33:27.625
If you need anything, just let me know.

33:27.705 --> 33:29.265
I'll handle it for you remotely.

33:30.465 --> 33:32.305
It won't affect work at all. Don't worry.

33:33.985 --> 33:34.825
Okay.

33:34.905 --> 33:35.985
Then I'll take you up on that.

33:36.065 --> 33:37.665
I'll go ask for leave.

33:38.385 --> 33:43.185
I'm sure that old fossil
is only going to ask one thing.

33:44.065 --> 33:44.905
The reason?

33:45.945 --> 33:47.465
My father was hospitalized after a stroke.

33:50.945 --> 33:52.185
Submit your leave request
through the proper process.

33:52.265 --> 33:53.545
Make sure your work
is properly handed over.

33:57.425 --> 33:58.625
That's it?

34:01.065 --> 34:02.185
What else?

34:06.985 --> 34:08.105
Thanks.

34:09.705 --> 34:10.824
Close the door.

35:31.945 --> 35:33.945
‎I feel there’s still a bit of an issue.

35:34.025 --> 35:36.065
Check this line.

35:36.145 --> 35:37.465
I think there's a problem.

35:37.545 --> 35:38.745
I'll check it.

35:39.425 --> 35:40.465
Just leave it here.

35:40.545 --> 35:41.465
Flora.

35:46.185 --> 35:47.225
Kitty.

35:53.585 --> 35:54.425
Flora.

35:55.385 --> 35:58.345
Why does this budget
have to be approved by Luke?

35:59.745 --> 36:02.265
Lime's budget management
has three core components.

36:02.345 --> 36:04.785
They include the approval process
and time limits.

36:04.865 --> 36:06.625
They're all clearly defined.

36:06.705 --> 36:08.905
Dony, you should know that, shouldn't you?

36:10.745 --> 36:11.705
All right.

36:12.225 --> 36:13.945
I'll follow the budget approval process.

36:14.025 --> 36:15.105
I'll get going.

36:28.905 --> 36:31.785
None of the top MCN resources
from our Beijing office can be used.

36:31.865 --> 36:33.945
Everything has to go through
the Hangzhou headquarters now.

36:34.025 --> 36:35.785
Isn't that basically
starting from scratch?

36:36.545 --> 36:39.825
The client just asked me
why this New Media campaign

36:39.905 --> 36:41.825
was suddenly moved
from Beijing to Hangzhou.

36:42.785 --> 36:44.425
They think the Beijing team
is more experienced

36:44.505 --> 36:45.625
and has better resources.

36:45.705 --> 36:46.585
They're concerned about the results.

36:47.545 --> 36:48.985
I didn't even know how to explain it.

36:50.585 --> 36:54.105
Just tell them
Hangzhou is an emerging city

36:54.185 --> 36:57.105
with enormous potential
that's poised for rapid growth.

36:57.185 --> 36:58.505
Potential?

36:58.585 --> 36:59.825
Based on the data,

36:59.905 --> 37:02.265
how does Hangzhou's new media ecosystem
or top-tier resources

37:02.345 --> 37:03.945
compare to Beijing's?

37:04.785 --> 37:06.065
The resources aren't there.

37:06.145 --> 37:07.305
The client's concerned.

37:07.385 --> 37:08.785
And the team's working themselves
to the bone.

37:10.585 --> 37:11.425
Where's Dony?

37:12.385 --> 37:14.265
I heard he's out
doing market research again.

37:14.945 --> 37:16.025
I saw Dony

37:16.105 --> 37:18.065
downstairs this morning
carrying a pot of orchids.

37:18.145 --> 37:19.425
They were beautiful.

37:19.505 --> 37:21.385
You could tell they were expensive.

37:21.465 --> 37:23.425
Yeah. Yesterday it was an art gallery.

37:23.505 --> 37:25.065
The day before, a tea house.

37:25.145 --> 37:26.225
So what came of all that research?

37:26.305 --> 37:27.945
How are we supposed
to explain it to the client?

37:28.025 --> 37:31.185
Tell them our boss went off
to drink tea and admire flowers?

37:31.265 --> 37:32.665
Let's just focus on our own work for now.

37:32.745 --> 37:34.065
When Dony gets back,

37:34.145 --> 37:36.345
ask him to give us clearer instructions
as soon as possible.

37:47.305 --> 37:49.505
BUDGET REQUEST APPROVED

37:49.585 --> 37:52.945
Why does this budget
have to be approved by Luke?

37:58.705 --> 37:59.865
Hello?

37:59.945 --> 38:02.265
-Did I interrupt you?
-No.

38:03.145 --> 38:04.585
I was walking Luke.

38:04.665 --> 38:05.785
What's up?

38:07.705 --> 38:11.305
Did you receive
the two budget requests from Dony?

38:11.385 --> 38:12.265
No.

38:13.305 --> 38:15.465
Is Dony in a rush
and asked you to follow up with me?

38:15.545 --> 38:16.665
No.

38:16.745 --> 38:18.065
According to the process,

38:18.145 --> 38:20.025
those two budget requests need your
signature before they can take effect.

38:20.105 --> 38:21.505
But somehow they skipped you.

38:22.345 --> 38:24.505
I've already received
the payment notification.

38:26.265 --> 38:28.265
I don't think the system
would miss something like that.

38:30.145 --> 38:31.145
Got it.

38:32.065 --> 38:33.705
Has he given you
a hard time anywhere else?

38:34.425 --> 38:35.345
No.

38:35.425 --> 38:37.225
He's hardly ever in the office.

38:39.225 --> 38:41.985
By the way, give me Sun Yu's number.

38:42.065 --> 38:44.025
A friend of mine in investment banking
wants to meet her.

38:45.025 --> 38:46.265
Maybe they'll invest in her.

38:50.785 --> 38:51.705
Thank you.

38:52.545 --> 38:53.665
I mean it.

38:55.985 --> 38:57.225
All right, then.

39:00.865 --> 39:02.025
Let's go. Luke.

39:20.305 --> 39:21.385
Coming.

39:27.625 --> 39:29.585
-Kitty.
-Flora.

39:30.385 --> 39:32.065
Sorry to bother you so late.

39:32.625 --> 39:33.705
Could you do me a favor?

39:34.785 --> 39:35.745
Sure.

39:40.345 --> 39:43.545
Could you report to Dony for me?

39:45.225 --> 39:46.465
Me?

39:47.065 --> 39:48.025
Yes.

39:48.785 --> 39:51.305
I… I still have some backend data
to finish processing.

39:51.385 --> 39:52.585
I'm a little pressed for time.

39:53.265 --> 39:55.265
But I've already finished the proposal.

39:57.385 --> 39:58.425
No problem. I'll go.

40:00.425 --> 40:01.625
Great. Thanks.

40:02.305 --> 40:03.185
No problem.

40:05.625 --> 40:06.665
Flora.

40:08.865 --> 40:11.225
If anything comes up later,
call me anytime.

40:11.305 --> 40:14.025
I'll be around. I can come over.

40:15.385 --> 40:17.265
Don't you need
to finish processing the data?

40:18.665 --> 40:23.625
Yeah. But Dony
can be pretty particular about work.

40:23.705 --> 40:25.785
When you report to him,

40:25.865 --> 40:27.505
pay attention to how you approach it.

40:30.705 --> 40:31.545
Don't worry.

40:34.745 --> 40:35.785
Okay.

40:55.625 --> 40:56.625
Why haven't you left yet?

40:59.945 --> 41:01.225
Let's go together.

41:09.105 --> 41:10.145
Flora.

41:12.665 --> 41:13.705
Kitty.

41:17.065 --> 41:17.945
Kitty.

41:30.105 --> 41:31.665
Are you afraid of Dony?

41:36.385 --> 41:37.585
The background check results are in.

41:38.625 --> 41:40.745
During his time at his previous company,

41:40.825 --> 41:42.705
Dony came under strong suspicion
of embezzlement.

41:44.345 --> 41:46.185
And it involved
a substantial amount of money.

41:49.665 --> 41:50.505
Specifically?

41:51.225 --> 41:54.225
He skimmed money through price differences
in supplier contracts.

41:54.305 --> 41:55.985
It wasn't a particularly
sophisticated scheme,

41:56.065 --> 41:58.905
but the investigation was quietly dropped.

41:59.505 --> 42:01.945
He left the company on the grounds
of personal career development.

42:02.665 --> 42:04.505
That does fit his usual style.

42:04.585 --> 42:06.705
I don't get it.

42:06.785 --> 42:09.225
How could someone with such
a serious black mark on his record

42:09.825 --> 42:13.745
be parachuted in by the board
to keep you in check?

42:15.745 --> 42:17.425
Who was it on the board
that brought Dony in?

42:18.705 --> 42:20.225
Mr. He. He Qiming.

42:22.105 --> 42:25.145
Last year, He Qiming strongly backed
that Southeast Asia project.

42:25.225 --> 42:27.105
I joined forces with several shareholders
to vote it down.

42:27.705 --> 42:29.185
I guess he felt humiliated.

42:29.745 --> 42:31.545
Divide and balance power. Create chaos.

42:32.665 --> 42:34.665
He just wants to see me fail.

42:34.745 --> 42:35.785
It's obvious.

42:36.705 --> 42:40.225
So, Dony works for him?

42:41.065 --> 42:42.305
More like a puppet.

42:42.945 --> 42:46.625
A puppet who's willing
to go head-to-head with me.

43:08.865 --> 43:11.585
Dony, we're here
to give you a work update.

43:15.785 --> 43:17.785
Could he be laundering money for Mr. He?

43:18.305 --> 43:19.705
Send Lumi to Hangzhou.

43:20.345 --> 43:22.345
Follow the trail back to the source.

43:23.105 --> 43:24.065
No.

43:24.145 --> 43:26.385
Lumi is known to be your right hand.

43:26.465 --> 43:28.545
If you do that, won't you tip them off?

43:29.625 --> 43:30.705
That's exactly the point.

43:31.585 --> 43:35.745
I want Lumi to openly investigate
the cash flow, ownership structure,

43:35.825 --> 43:38.265
and beneficial owners
behind those companies.

43:38.345 --> 43:39.785
Peel back the layers,

43:39.865 --> 43:41.385
and eventually we'll expose
the person behind it all.

43:44.065 --> 43:45.185
You're good at this.

44:19.705 --> 44:20.905
You're still up?

44:23.705 --> 44:27.305
Sun Yu's project
isn't performing very well.

44:27.385 --> 44:28.985
I'm helping her revise her business plan.

44:37.465 --> 44:38.945
Sun Yu's making a dating app?

44:40.385 --> 44:42.825
Take a look at this proposal for me.

44:42.905 --> 44:44.625
You're the expert
when it comes to investments.

44:56.745 --> 44:58.105
The business plan isn't strong enough.

44:58.185 --> 44:59.145
The data isn't convincing enough.

44:59.905 --> 45:01.145
And the key selling points
don't stand out.

45:03.105 --> 45:04.385
Then,

45:05.825 --> 45:08.745
how can a proposal attract investors?

45:09.345 --> 45:12.305
Shang Zhitao, I'm on leave,
and you're still making me work.

45:23.305 --> 45:24.985
It's not like
you've got anything else to do.

45:25.785 --> 45:27.345
Help me polish the business plan.

45:34.785 --> 45:36.065
Now you're pushing your luck.
